  "collectible_spell_count": 3,
  "token_count": 2,
  "notes": [
    "Blizzard 20.0 patch notes call the 2021 Classic historical target 1.0.0.5832. This artifact explicitly pins the actual HearthSim archive build 5834 rather than relabeling it.",
    "The original eleven selected cards have no gameplay/localization field differences between builds 5506 and 5834. The six normal-match additions are independently extracted from 5834 only.",
    "Harvest Golem and Damaged Golem have no Mech tribe tag in this June 2014 archive. River Crocolisk is a Beast. Do not add later tribe changes.",
    "Spell schools did not exist in this build. Do not label the spells with modern formal school tags.",
    "The historical CardDefs entity ID attributes are all zero; numeric dbf_id values come from the same commit manifest-cards.csv.",
    "text_raw retains Blizzard formatting and $ spell-damage markers; text removes only these presentation markers. Cards without ability text have an empty string.",
    "Elven Archer can target either hero or any other minion, friendly or enemy, but cannot target itself. Spell damage does not increase a minion Battlecry.",
    "The ability payloads encode the intended implementation of the archived printed card effects; archived client Power GUIDs alone are not executable server scripts.",
    "Normal matches add five non-legendary neutral collectibles to permit a legal thirty-card Mage deck (fifteen distinct cards, two copies each). The original eleven practice records are preserved unchanged.",
    "GAME_005 is a non-collectible neutral spell with zero default cost. Its archive has no COST, CLASS, COLLECTIBLE or RARITY tags; normalized cost/class/collectible use the game defaults and source_rarity_enum remains null. Its temporary mana semantics are interpreted from the archived printed effect; opening-flow rules are documented separately."
  ],
